# Firebase (public web config) — matematika multiplayer + kahoot live
#
# Bu qiymatlar brauzerda ochiq ko'rinadi (public), maxfiy kalit emas.
# Xavfsizlikni Firestore security rules boshqaradi — frontendda hech qanday
# service_account / service_role / private key bo'lishi shart emas.
